                                                "sense_id": "384d59a4-6c5d-3ca4-8c52-a4b552fc3da6",
                                                "text": "Apophenia, Win had declared it, after due consideration and in his careful way: the spontaneous perception of connections and meaningfulness in unrelated things. And had never, as far as Cayce knows, said another word about it."
